# SYNTHETIC — hand-written from RFC 1939, not a recording.
# The phase-0 capture against a real server has not happened yet.
# -ERR on RETR is a refusal of that command, not an authentication failure.
# The session stops; it does not wait for a dot terminator after -ERR.

S: +OK POP3 server ready
C: RETR 9
S: -ERR no such message
FAIL Refused
